          <div>
            <div class="relative w-full h-72 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-surface-container mb-space-md shadow-inner">
              <%= image_tag "nequis/creadora-joseling.jpg",
                    alt: "Joseling Bermúdez sonriendo en su estudio creativo mientras trabaja en una tablet de diseño",
                    class: "w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105",
                    loading: "lazy",
                    decoding: "async" %>

              <div class="absolute top-3 left-3 flex gap-2">
                <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-primary-fixed text-primary font-label-sm text-label-sm shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md">Co-fundadora</span>
              </div>
              <div class="absolute bottom-3 right-3 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest/90 backdrop-blur-md flex items-center justify-center text-primary shadow-sm">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]" aria-hidden="true">brush</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-1 mb-space-sm">
              <p class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]" aria-hidden="true">draw</span>
                Creatividad &amp; Diseño
              </p>
              <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface">Joseling Bermúdez</h3>
            </div>

            <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-space-md">
              “La mente creativa encargada de dar vida visual a cada idea, ilustrar con amor y convertir pensamientos en diseños hermosos y vibrantes listos para sublimar.”
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-space-sm flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm group-hover:bg-tertiary-fixed transition-colors">#IlustraciónCreativa</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm group-hover:bg-tertiary-fixed transition-colors">#DirecciónDeArte</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm group-hover:bg-tertiary-fixed transition-colors">#DiseñoConAlma</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="group rounded-3xl bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-lg shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(46,31,56,0.06)] hover:-translate-y-1.5 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="absolute -right-10 -top-10 w-32 h-32 bg-secondary-fixed rounded-full blur-2xl opacity-60 group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform duration-500" aria-hidden="true"></div>

          <div>
            <div class="relative w-full h-72 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-surface-container mb-space-md shadow-inner">
              <%= image_tag "nequis/creadora-greyschell.jpg",
                    alt: "Greyschell Alemán rodeada de cajas de regalo y papel de seda en tonos pastel",
                    class: "w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105",
                    loading: "lazy",
                    decoding: "async" %>

              <div class="absolute top-3 left-3 flex gap-2">
                <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-secondary-fixed text-on-secondary-fixed font-label-sm text-label-sm shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md">Co-fundadora</span>
              </div>
              <div class="absolute bottom-3 right-3 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest/90 backdrop-blur-md flex items-center justify-center text-secondary shadow-sm">
