            </div>

            <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-space-md">
              “La voz y el corazón comunicativo de NEQUIS. Conecta con nuestra hermosa comunidad, cuida la identidad de nuestra marca y asegura que cada historia llegue al corazón adecuado.”
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-space-sm flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm group-hover:bg-secondary-fixed transition-colors">#BrandIdentity</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm group-hover:bg-secondary-fixed transition-colors">#ComunidadNEQUIS</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm group-hover:bg-secondary-fixed transition-colors">#MarketingDigital</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="group rounded-3xl bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-lg shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(46,31,56,0.06)] hover:-translate-y-1.5 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1">
