              “Crear productos personalizados mediante la sublimación, combinando creatividad, calidad y originalidad para hacer realidad las ideas de nuestros clientes.”
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-space-md flex items-center gap-2 text-primary font-label-sm text-label-sm">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]" aria-hidden="true">verified</span>
            <span>Compromiso artesanal en cada entrega</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-space-lg rounded-3xl bg-surface-container-lowest border-2 border-secondary-fixed shadow-[0_16px_36px_rgba(46,31,56,0.04)] relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div class="absolute -right-8 -top-8 w-28 h-28 bg-secondary-fixed rounded-full blur-2xl opacity-40 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="space-y-space-sm relative z-10">
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-secondary-fixed text-on-secondary-fixed font-label-sm text-label-sm w-max">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]" aria-hidden="true">visibility</span>
              <span>Futuro</span>
            </div>
            <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-headline-lg text-on-surface">Nuestra visión</h2>
            <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
              “Ser una marca reconocida por transformar ideas en productos únicos, destacando por nuestra creatividad, calidad e innovación.”
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-space-md flex items-center gap-2 text-secondary font-label-sm text-label-sm">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]" aria-hidden="true">stars</span>
            <span>Innovación constante con identidad propia</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full px-6 lg:px-12 py-space-md" aria-labelledby="valores-title">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-space-xl">
        <span class="inline-block px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-tertiary-fixed text-on-tertiary-fixed font-label-sm text-label-sm">El Manifiesto NEQUIS</span>
        <h2 id="valores-title" class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-headline-lg text-on-surface mt-space-xs mb-space-xs">Nuestros Valores</h2>
        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Los cinco pilares esenciales que guían cada diseño, cada estampación y cada sonrisa entregada.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-space-lg">
        <div class="rounded-3xl bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-lg shadow-[0_12px_32px_rgba(46,31,56,0.05)] hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div class="space-y-space-md">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-primary-fixed flex items-center justify-center text-primary">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[28px]" aria-hidden="true">palette</span>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-space-xs">
              <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Creatividad</h3>
              <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Ideas originales en cada diseño.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-space-md pt-space-sm">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-primary font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]" aria-hidden="true">brush</span>
              Diseños que sorprenden
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-3xl bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-lg shadow-[0_12px_32px_rgba(46,31,56,0.05)] hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div class="space-y-space-md">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-secondary-fixed flex items-center justify-center text-secondary">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[28px]" aria-hidden="true">verified</span>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-space-xs">
              <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Calidad</h3>
              <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Cuidado en cada detalle.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-space-md pt-space-sm">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-secondary font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]" aria-hidden="true">task_alt</span>
              Sublimación duradera
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-3xl bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-lg shadow-[0_12px_32px_rgba(46,31,56,0.05)] hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div class="space-y-space-md">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-tertiary-fixed flex items-center justify-center text-tertiary">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[28px]" aria-hidden="true">fingerprint</span>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-space-xs">
              <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Originalidad</h3>
              <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Productos con identidad propia.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-space-md pt-space-sm">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-tertiary font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]" aria-hidden="true">star</span>
              100% personalizados
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-3xl bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-lg shadow-[0_12px_32px_rgba(46,31,56,0.05)] hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div class="space-y-space-md">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-primary-fixed flex items-center justify-center text-primary">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[28px]" aria-hidden="true">handshake</span>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-space-xs">
              <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Compromiso</h3>
              <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Responsabilidad con nuestros clientes.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-space-md pt-space-sm">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-primary font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]" aria-hidden="true">support_agent</span>
              Cercanía en todo momento
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-3xl bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-lg shadow-[0_12px_32px_rgba(46,31,56,0.05)] hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow flex flex-col justify-between md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1">
          <div class="space-y-space-md">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-secondary-fixed flex items-center justify-center text-secondary">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[28px]" aria-hidden="true">favorite</span>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-space-xs">
              <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Pasión</h3>
              <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Amor por lo que hacemos.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-space-md pt-space-sm">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-secondary font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]" aria-hidden="true">volunteer_activism</span>
              Hecho con el corazón
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full px-6 lg:px-12 py-space-xl" aria-labelledby="consejos-title">
      <div data-controller="creator-tabs" class="p-space-lg rounded-3xl bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-[0_16px_40px_rgba(46,31,56,0.04)]">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-space-sm pb-space-md">
          <div>
            <h2 id="consejos-title" class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Un tip de cada creadora para tu regalo perfecto</h2>
            <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Haz clic para descubrir sus secretos favoritos de personalización</p>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 p-1 bg-surface-container rounded-full" id="creator-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Consejos de las creadoras">
            <button
              type="button"
              id="tab-btn-joseling"
              class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-all flex items-center gap-1 text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface"
              role="tab"
              aria-selected="false"
              aria-controls="tab-joseling"
              tabindex="-1"
              data-creator-tabs-target="tab"
              data-key="joseling"
              data-action="click->creator-tabs#select keydown->creator-tabs#navigate"
            >
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]" aria-hidden="true">palette</span>
              Joseling
            </button>
            <button
              type="button"
              id="tab-btn-greyschell"
              class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-all flex items-center gap-1 text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface"
              role="tab"
              aria-selected="false"
              aria-controls="tab-greyschell"
              tabindex="-1"
              data-creator-tabs-target="tab"
              data-key="greyschell"
              data-action="click->creator-tabs#select keydown->creator-tabs#navigate"
            >
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]" aria-hidden="true">sms</span>
              Greyschell
            </button>
            <button
              type="button"
              id="tab-btn-cinthia"
              class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-all flex items-center gap-1 bg-primary text-on-primary"
              role="tab"
              aria-selected="true"
              aria-controls="tab-cinthia"
              data-creator-tabs-target="tab"
              data-key="cinthia"
              data-action="click->creator-tabs#select keydown->creator-tabs#navigate"
            >
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]" aria-hidden="true">task_alt</span>
              Cinthia
            </button>
